{"id":"603875","name":"茄子尖椒凉面","author":"家yao","authorId":"9997497","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/603875/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"刀切面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"1根"},{"name":"尖椒","amount":"1根"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1 根"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"精盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茄子、尖椒洗净。","img":"images/603875/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茄子切小丁块儿。","img":"images/603875/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"尖椒大半个切小丁块儿，小半个切大一点儿的块儿。","img":"images/603875/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油热，炒茄子丁儿，多翻炒一会儿，将茄子炒软、炒油。","img":"images/603875/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入尖椒丁儿翻炒。","img":"images/603875/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放酱油，快速翻炒。","img":"images/603875/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放大尖椒块儿，翻炒两下。","img":"images/603875/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加水，加盐、鸡精、十三香，炖一会儿，加淀粉，翻匀，出锅。","img":"images/603875/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"茄子尖椒卤儿。","img":"images/603875/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鲜面条。","img":"images/603875/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开，煮。","img":"images/603875/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"过凉水。","img":"images/603875/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"插黄瓜丝。","img":"images/603875/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"喜欢辣，可加辣椒油。","img":"images/603875/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/603875/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}